      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们又见面了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n还记得我这个调香师大姐姐吗？\n我会用宝可梦身体的一部分调制香水哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC53C889C197624E86FF0100100001BE01000A8FD88BB05F9762118FD94E2A8C0399995E08592759D059D05417FF1F000A62114F1A75285B9D53EF68A68EAB4F5376844E0090E852068C03523699996C3454E6FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实呀，\n我又有调制新香水的好主意了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E5440FF0C000A621153C867098C03523665B099996C347684597D4E3B610F4E86300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次我看中的是\n迷你冰喷出的白雪！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B216211770B4E2D7684662F000A8FF74F6051B055B751FA7684767D96EAFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仿佛冰淇淋一般\n纯白又柔软的迷你冰……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它到底会散发出怎样的味道呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EFF4F5B51B06DC76DCB4E00822C000A7EAF767D53C867D48F6F76848FF74F6051B02026202600100001BE00000A5B8352305E954F1A656353D151FA600E683776845473905354622026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你愿意，\n就带着迷你冰来找我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60613F610FFF0C000A5C315E2677408FF74F6051B06765627E62115427FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是捉到迷你冰了，\n请把它加入同行宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F634952308FF74F6051B04E86FF0C000A8BF7628A5B8352A05165540C884C5B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你帮我把\n迷你冰带过来了呀！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是太感谢你了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E2E6211628A000A8FF74F6051B05E268FC767654E865440FF0100100001BE00000A771F662F592A611F8C224F604E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那话不多说，\n我来取一点迷你冰的雪！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A38BDD4E0D591A8BF4FF0C000A6211676553D64E0070B98FF74F6051B0768496EAFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好、好凉啊！\n不愧是会吐出零下50度冷气的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D3001597D51C9554AFF01000A4E0D6127662F4F1A541051FA96F64E0B003500305EA651B76C1476845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一般来说雪是没有味道的，\n但宝可梦的雪一定能调制出香水！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00822C67658BF496EA662F6CA16709547390537684FF0C000A4F465B9D53EF68A6768496EA4E005B9A80FD8C03523651FA99996C34FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "迷你冰的香水调好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FF74F6051B0768499996C348C03597D4E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真没想到呀！迷你冰的雪\n闻起来是淡淡的甜～味！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F6CA160F352305440FF018FF74F6051B0768496EA000A95FB8D776765662F6DE16DE17684751CFF5E5473FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是闻着这个香味，\n身体会一下子凉快下来，好神奇啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F95FB77408FD94E2A99995473FF0C000A8EAB4F534F1A4E004E0B5B5051C95FEB4E0B6765FF0C597D795E5947554AFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我预感它会在南国阿罗拉地区大受欢迎！\n它让我看到宝可梦香水的可能性！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62119884611F5B834F1A5728535756FD963F7F5762C95730533A592753D76B228FCEFF01000A5B838BA96211770B52305B9D53EF68A699996C34768453EF80FD6027FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦的香水拥有无限可能！\n今后有什么事的话，还要麻烦你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A6768499996C3462E5670965E0965053EF80FDFF01000A4ECA540E67094EC04E484E8B76848BDDFF0C8FD889819EBB70E64F604E86300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
